{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月20日 08:36 星期五</p>\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">最後更新   2026年11月20日 09:02 星期五</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>位於皇崗口岸聯檢大樓負二層一間連鎖便利店已於周三（18日）開業，是大樓內首間投入營運的商舖。皇崗口岸24小時通關，該便利店則從每天上午7時營業至午夜12時。便利店負責人表示，這是因為深圳地鐵晚上收車後不再有客流經過負二層。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>該便利店在深圳灣口岸的分店已於周二開業。負責人強調，兩間店舖的開業時間並非有意迎合深圳APEC峰會，只是恰好在這幾天驗收通過。</p><h2>明報記者</h2></div><p>相關字詞﹕皇崗口岸 便利店 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:43:51.010460+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":252,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T00:36:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T05:37:32.736848+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T01:37:27.190672+00:00","content_hash":"1654daae1c7b950b4efa5bdec0c49d0a1b7f252b3a765cf5b7955496ef20da05","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}